Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can do\Nis I can't wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what I'm expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon and OgreMon\Ndecided to stop fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,each other and face Metal Etemon together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the rest of the gang had\Ntheir own problems with PuppetMon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but thanks to a brief appearance\Nby Matt and Metal Garurumon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he finally got his strings cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Risking all to save Leomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liamond threw himself in\Nfront of a vicious blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did you vault to Zudomon\Nand used my Vulcan's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hammer to put a serious dent\Nin Metal Edomon's armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought Leomon would\Nreturn to a Digi-Egg,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Primary Village was poisoned by evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it'll stay that way until all\Nof the Dark Masters are defeated.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Orders to Bomb! Mugendramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This road has to be\Ngoing somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is certain in the digi-world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a furball, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, silly. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing is certain only a\Ncactus could love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to stay out of the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we've got to find a way\Nto get her fever down soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you didn't say\Nsomething before now, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:03:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we'd known sooner, we could\Nhave rested until you felt better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to slow everyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We probably shouldn't have\Neven brought her along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to bring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need her if we want\Nto save the Digi-world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one of the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all, but her being sick, we\Nshould have left her someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have split up so someone could\Ntake care of her while the others looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, this isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a part of what I do\Nto be a good leader, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look right up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted civilization?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't get\Nmore civilized than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that America?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that isn't. That's Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We studied it in geography, and up there,\Nthat's the Arc de Triomphe in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all smooshed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like that theme park in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except that this place is deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's not a sign of life anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy, Kari's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find some place to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, this looks like a nice, quiet spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These cupboards are empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not even a speck of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Agumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find some aspirin?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.97,0:04:47.09,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\be1\frz330\pos(392,87)\fad(0,300)}Take that cold out cold!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.97,0:04:47.09,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\be1\frz330\pos(405,122)\fad(0,300)}Sneezing, runny nose, & nasal congestion
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this ought to do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like everything\Nelse, this place is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, humans aren't supposed to\Nbe this color, are they? Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to leave in case something\Nhappens, but she needs medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's stable, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is hope\Nher fever breaks soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Least I know I'm leaving\Nher in good hands with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Tai, I want to come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't get in the way, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, you're my last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the Dark Masters come, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you here to look after the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I could count on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is deserted, but I still\Nget the feeling we're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the digital age, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a lot simpler\Nways of finding things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was beginning to get a crab in my wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an online map of the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, you're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now I'll search for\Nhospitals and pharmacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackpot, take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's the closest. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta unplug myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have logged off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Lord Machinedramon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've accessed maps and things\Nfor hospitals and pharmacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.34,0:06:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're waiting for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me those locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right away, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are, uh, one, two, three, four,\Nfive, six, seven, eight, nine, ten, eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,twelve of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me put this in words\Nyou can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send units to all twelve\Nlocations and blow them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now! Blow them up! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it already done, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little fool has swallowed the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it is time to spring the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was getting a little stuffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:07:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder this hospital is so\Nclean, there's no sick people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found the pharmacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of medicine, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we know what to\Nuse for Kari's fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange as it sounds,\NI wish Joe were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might know what these are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His father's a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a doctor's kid for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's never one around\Nwhen you need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can patch into the hospital's computer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As he shoots, he scores!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fever reduction. Children. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The network is being accessed\Nfrom inside Target 4, Master, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then wouldn't it be a good\Nidea to have all forces
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,converge on that target\Nand prepare to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.90,0:07:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a brilliant idea, my lord, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you, Megadramon. Oh, no. After you.
