Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.84,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs700\bord0\fscx240\c&HDBDBD2&\pos(798,-352)\fad(0,300)}-
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.84,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs700\bord0\fscx240\c&HDBDBD2&\pos(798,-276)\fad(0,300)}-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy, you sure\Nthat's the right stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the safest children's aspirin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, then let's get back. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky we're in a hospital, because\Nit looks like we might need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they? Nekanori-mon!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:40.24,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Mechanorimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:40.24,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:40.24,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:40.24,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Machine Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:40.24,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:40.24,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Twinkle Beam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil robots with one job!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blasting Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest we get out of here and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twinkle Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They brought along a friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.98,0:09:13.69,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Tankmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.98,0:09:13.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.98,0:09:13.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.98,0:09:13.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.98,0:09:13.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.98,0:09:13.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Hyper Cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tankmon, an armor-plated bully\Nwith a sneeze like a cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think the other guys are bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these creeps have more\Nfirepower than a volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they find us so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them must have been following\Nus and saw us come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big, Kari needs us to get back pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hyper cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really getting tired of that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are they gonna call\Nit quits and go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go down there\Nand take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those rolling arsenals\Nare just waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We show ourselves and\Nthey'll go ballistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we just hide here all day, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those machines are the only\Nthings moving out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so a map of the city's traffic\Nflow will show us where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's just a question of plotting\Nthe best course to avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, I've pinpointed every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, your metal myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are accessing the network again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the access point is\Nrelocated to sector B-17.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then relay those coordinates\Nto all forces and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inconceivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:11:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incon-what? What now? The machines!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of them rotated in sync\Nand now they're heading our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're zeroing in on\Nmy computer connection!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the jump guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the jump guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plot sickens. Ah, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had such high hopes that these little\Nones would put on a more entertaining show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this, really, it's too tiresome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we just get this over with and get\Non to something a little less tedious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape from Machine Drummond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's designed for total annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nnow before he catches them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's not fair that that overgrown\Ncan opener gets all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was so looking forward\Nto playing with them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. Digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dream on, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.86,0:13:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got a teeny bit of bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nave escaped again, my lord, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was giving away our location every\Ntime I logged on with my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have not\Nthought of that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Kari's getting sicker\Nand sicker because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's come over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:13:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai, this isn't your normal behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She almost died once before because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened when she was four\Nor five, just a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She stayed home from kindergarten\None day because she was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I knew she was sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but all I could think about on\Nthe way home was playing soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go out and play, but I\Ndidn't want to leave her by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I took her outside with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She seemed okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you have been thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew she was sick!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.71,0:15:07.71,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&H000000&\move(318,250,318,290)\t(000,5900,\fs31)}No Visitors
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.71,0:15:07.71,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&H000000&\fs12\move(527,207,693,207)\t(0,6100,\fs19)}Yagami Hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She ended up with\Npneumonia or something. She
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,almost didn't make it\Nbut what really kills me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is what she said when\Nthey brought her home from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hospital the first\Nwords out of her mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm sorry I can't\Nkick the ball very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll probably never\Nwant to play with me again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's her. That's Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never thinks about herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if she feels bad or\Nshe's bummed out about other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always worried about the other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd be just fine if she never\Ncame to this stupid place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she came because she\Nknew that we needed her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never thought about what she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because she cares. She's a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm her big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to look after her and protect\Nher and think of what's best for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it would be ridiculous\Nto try to break through them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but maybe we can use their own\Nsurveillance techniques against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going online again, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but this time I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a program that'll\Nthrow them off our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to mask our access point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little trick a computer\Nprogrammer taught me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are now dozens of access\Npoints all over the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean what I think\Nit does, my lord, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you have the brains of a tin can?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the enemy Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because the program worked and they\Ndon't have a clue where to look for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pro-digis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting\Nfor? Let's get going
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm bored with this game of cat and mouse
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:17:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Initiate plan, eliminate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, eliminate? How about eliminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually questioning me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Initiate plan eliminate\Nnow No sir, yes sir
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention! Initiate! Plan! Eliminate!\NAttention! Initiate! Plan! Eliminate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.48,0:17:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you agree. Fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I blow something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're in for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark side attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what a waste of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:17:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think they're shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:17:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:12.36,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Megadramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:12.36,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:12.36,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:12.36,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:12.36,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:12.36,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Genocide Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Megadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a fully digiball flying fiend with\Ndevastating destructive powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the other one's gigadramon if anything he's\Nmore powerful than his buddy believe me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.36,0:18:21.32,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Gigadramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.36,0:18:21.32,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.36,0:18:21.32,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.36,0:18:21.32,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.36,0:18:21.32,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.36,0:18:21.32,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Genocide Gear
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if these guys were\Nshooting at us we wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.42,0:18:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still be here talking about it looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my plan may have backfired on us how do\Nyou figure that it appears they've decided
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,searching for us is too much trouble so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead they're just\Ngonna level the whole city
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everybody in it!\NYou've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it for sectors a and b what a mess
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,megadramon and Gigadramon have begun\Noperations in sectors c and d children sneaky
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon there will be no\Nplace left to hide and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this game will abruptly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end uh-oh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,megadramon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:19:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's heading right for where the others\Nare hiding no i hope they see I am coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The building's gone!\NNo! No way! It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K., Biyomon, and the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you look better than okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought we'd better get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I led the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took care of him, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't rely on scrap metal\Nif you want the job done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take cover, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scurry away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask any Redcatcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chase is part of the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As Machinedramon succeeded in\Ndestroying the Digidestined,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't miss the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to run\Naway from the sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be able\Nto get an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid of my future, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going to be able to give\Nyou a smile. I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of my\Nheart. I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to let\Nyou know one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still looking forward to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still looking forward to\Nthe future. I'm still looking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forward
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.82,0:23:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the next episode of DIGIMON\NADVENTURE: Goodbye, Numemon! Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the adventure evolves.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.94,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Goodbye, Numemon

